Relevant columns and their potential usage  
------------------------------------------------  
"PRODUCTS"."id": join key to associate each order‑item with its product  
"PRODUCTS"."category": filter to only rows where value = ‘Sleep & Lounge’  
"PRODUCTS"."cost": per‑unit product cost (needed for total‑cost & profit)  
"ORDER_ITEMS"."product_id": join key to the product table  
"ORDER_ITEMS"."sale_price": per‑unit selling price (needed for total‑sales & profit)  
"ORDER_ITEMS"."status": keep only rows whose value = ‘Complete’  
"ORDER_ITEMS"."order_id": link to the parent order (needed to count complete orders)  
"ORDER_ITEMS"."created_at": micro‑second epoch of the order‑item creation (used to keep the 01‑Jan‑2023 → 31‑Dec‑2023 window and to derive the month)  
"ORDERS"."order_id": join key back to order_items (extra validation)  
"ORDERS"."status": another place to insist on ‘Complete’ orders if desired  
"ORDERS"."created_at": alternate timestamp for the 2023 window  
Conditions that will be used  
• "PRODUCTS"."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'  
• "ORDER_ITEMS"."status" = 'Complete' (and optionally "ORDERS"."status" = 'Complete')  
• "ORDER_ITEMS"."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000 (micro‑seconds for 1‑Jan‑2023 and 31‑Dec‑2023 23:59:59)  

Exploratory / progressive Snowflake SQL (LIMIT 20 rows each)  
------------------------------------------------------------  

```sql
--Description: 1) Inspect the list of distinct product categories
SELECT DISTINCT "category"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 2) Sample 20 products that belong to the ‘Sleep & Lounge’ category
SELECT  "id",
        "name",
        "brand",
        "retail_price",
        "cost"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"
WHERE   "category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 3) Grab 20 order‑items from 2023 that are marked Complete (no product join yet)
SELECT  "id",
        "order_id",
        "product_id",
        "sale_price",
        "created_at"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"
WHERE   "status" = 'Complete'
  AND   "created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 4) Join order‑items with their product rows limited to ‘Sleep & Lounge’
SELECT  oi."id"                         AS "order_item_id",
        oi."order_id",
        p."name"                        AS "product_name",
        oi."sale_price",
        p."cost"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"   oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"      p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category"  = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"   = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 5) Calculate sales vs. cost for each individual order‑item
SELECT  oi."id"                                                AS "order_item_id",
        oi."sale_price"                                        AS "sale_price",
        p."cost"                                               AS "unit_cost",
        (oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                           AS "profit"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 6) Attach the parent order row just to double‑check statuses
SELECT  oi."id"        AS "order_item_id",
        o."order_id",
        o."status"     AS "order_status",
        oi."status"    AS "item_status",
        oi."sale_price",
        p."cost"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS"       o
       ON oi."order_id"  = o."order_id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   o."status"   = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 7) Aggregate at the order level: total sale, total cost, profit per order (sample 20)
SELECT  oi."order_id",
        SUM(oi."sale_price")                      AS "order_sales",
        SUM(p."cost")                             AS "order_cost",
        SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")           AS "order_profit"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
GROUP BY oi."order_id"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 8) Bring the DATE_TRUNC function to derive the month for each order‑item
SELECT  DATE_TRUNC('month', TO_TIMESTAMP(oi."created_at" / 1000000))    AS "month",
        oi."sale_price",
        p."cost"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 9) Monthly aggregation of sales, cost, and profit (still capped at 20 months which is fine here)
SELECT  DATE_TRUNC('month', TO_TIMESTAMP(oi."created_at" / 1000000))        AS "month",
        SUM(oi."sale_price")                                               AS "total_sales",
        SUM(p."cost")                                                      AS "total_cost",
        SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                    AS "total_profit",
        COUNT(DISTINCT oi."order_id")                                      AS "complete_orders"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
GROUP BY 1
ORDER BY 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 10) Final report: add profit‑to‑cost ratio
SELECT  DATE_TRUNC('month', TO_TIMESTAMP(oi."created_at" / 1000000))        AS "month",
        SUM(oi."sale_price")                                               AS "total_sales",
        SUM(p."cost")                                                      AS "total_cost",
        COUNT(DISTINCT oi."order_id")                                      AS "complete_orders",
        SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost")                                    AS "total_profit",
        CASE WHEN SUM(p."cost") = 0 THEN NULL
             ELSE ROUND(SUM(oi."sale_price" - p."cost") / SUM(p."cost"), 4)
        END                                                                AS "profit_to_cost_ratio"
FROM    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"  oi
JOIN    "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"     p
       ON oi."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE   p."category" = 'Sleep & Lounge'
  AND   oi."status"  = 'Complete'
  AND   oi."created_at" BETWEEN 1672531200000000 AND 1704067199000000
GROUP BY 1
ORDER BY 1
LIMIT 20;
```

